        <pre><code>Young stars: blue, massive, short-lived
Old stars: red, low-mass, long-lived
Stellar clusters: open, globular
Binary stars: common in galaxies
Variable stars: Cepheids, RR Lyrae</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Morphology</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Hubble Sequence</h3>
        <pre><code>Ellipticals (E0-E7): smooth, no structure
Spirals (Sa-Sc): disk + bulge + arms
Barred spirals (SBa-SBc): bar + disk + arms
Irregulars: no regular structure
Lenticulars (S0): disk without arms</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

